Then $\tilde{\mathbbm{t}}:=(\mathcal{U}, \mathcal{V})$ is a $t$-structure on $\mathcal{K}_2$. In particular, if $\mathbbm{t}$ is bounded, then $\tilde{\mathbbm{t}}$ is also bounded.
